![Photo by Jim Harris on Unsplash](cover.jpg)

One day a Land Lord with a huge vast and fertile land wanted to
start a winery. He wanted to use all his beautiful land to produce
the tastiest wine and share it to all his friends and family to
enjoy and be happy. So he started to search for a good Wine Maker to
create the best possible wine using the available resources.

He sent letters to all places he could think of. Many replied but
didn´t met the Land Lord´s requirements.

One invitation arrived to the hands of a young Wine Maker.

This wine maker was from a far away land, he accepted the offer and
traveled to the Land Lord´s country leaving all his family and
friends behind. When he arrived, the Land Lord was super happy.
Finally someone who could build the winery of his dreams.

The Land Lord pass him the Map of his land and tell him how much
wine he wanted to make and how happy the people would be having this
splendid wine. But he didn´t know what kind of wine he wanted nor if
his land was capable of producing wine. Then the young wine maker
started to work day and night, he first studied the land.

Which areas could you plant the seeds?, What tools do we need for
preparing this land?. Where do we store the ripped grapes?. Then he
look at the seeds.

What is the best seed to use, Carménère, Sauvignon, Merlot?, How
much seeds do we need?, What nutrients are needed for the seeds?.
Answering these and more questions the days passed and the Wine Maker
puts all his heart and knowledge into this project. Using the best
tools and latest Wine Making technology and techniques. But the Land
Lord wasn´t happy.

He hired this wine maker for creating his winery and producing the
best wine possible. But all he did for a month was studing the land,
talking to sommeliers and other wine makers and reading books about
the matter. He hired him to build a winery not for attending a
university course!.

The Land Lord wanted the winery fast because he feared the King
could make his own winery soon and he wouldn’t compete with the
King´s Winery!. He wanted to create a winery so all the people know
him first and then the King could buy him the winery instead of
creating one of its own. Where are my grapes?, Where is the wine? The
Land lord then hired two Apple Juice Makers for assisting the Wine
Maker and get the winery done quicker. The Apple Juice Makers were
really good Apple Juice Specialists.

But they didn´t have the experience of Wine Making. They didn´t
understand what the Wine Maker was doing. And tried to implement
Apple Juice Making techniques to the Wine Making process.

When they saw the Wine Maker was just starting to plant the seeds
after a month of work. They told the Land Lord that the Wine Maker
doesn´t followed the right process and the progress he made so far
was poor. The Land Lord was dissapointed and told The Wine Maker
that he wanted to use what all the Best Apple Juice Makers use.

Then he sent back the Wine Maker to his home land.

Finally the Land Lord travelled to another country searching a new
Wine Maker that can deliver his winery fast. But this Wine Maker will
put the same passion and love that the previous one gave?, Will this
wine be the best wine possible?.

Land Lord at the end have Apple juice instead of Wine.
